    <!-- // Bio -->
    <section class="mcp-card" aria-labelledby="bio-title">
      <h2 id="bio-title" class="mcp-h">Bio</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        I'm a Software and AI Engineer. I graduated with top honors in Informatics / Computer Science and AI from Institut Teknologi Nasional (ITENAS) Bandung (GPA 3.49 / 4.00, Class of 2026).
      </p>
      <p>
